<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Your Post Has Been Approved</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #d4edda; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .content { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; border-radius: 5px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #28a745; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
        .success { color: #155724; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h2 class="success">🎉 Your Post Has Been Approved!</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{ post.author.email }},</p>

        <p>Great news! Your post "<strong>{{ post.title }}</strong>" has been approved and is now live on the blog.</p>

        {% if post.approvedAt %}
            <p>Your post was approved on {{ post.approvedAt|date('F j, Y \a\t g:i A') }}.</p>
        {% endif %}

        <p>You can view your published post here:</p>

        <a href="{{ postUrl }}" class="btn">View Your Post</a>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            Thank you for contributing to our community. We’re excited to share your work with our readers!
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <small>This is an automated message from BlogApp. Please do not reply.</small>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
